ruck", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198119162221/", "num_games_owned": 436, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 1029, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 570, "last_played": 1770846916, "avatar": "290bf61b228094d586222d05d885320e77497b61"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm having a lot of fun playing this game, granted I'm only playing the vanilla game seeing all the reviews regarding mods. The base game by itself is some of the most fun I've had in a SP game like Escape From Duckov. I've never played an extraction shooter, but this one is definitely a great game to expose yourself to the genre. \r\n\r\nIf you're not trying to download mods and just wanna enjoy the game itself, I can safely say I recommend this game.", "timestamp_created": 1769198503, "timestamp_updated": 1769198503, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216626539", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007726613", "personaname": "Zebra3", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198007726613/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5468, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1325, "last_played": 1777378435, "avatar": "b60a442bff8d5d4ffcb5ae1b3a1fd1206a7d6f00"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great fun, no hard core shooter but deeper elements are there if you want and a great palette cleanser to EFT play.", "timestamp_created": 1769192539, "timestamp_updated": 1769192539, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503447949886322021", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": fals