 "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Q8Nero/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 3850, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1257, "last_played": 1774589594, "avatar": "00ee34e694638c90a38352385bf1f34522381f96"}, "language": "english", "review": "Better than Tarkov.", "timestamp_created": 1769153520, "timestamp_updated": 1769153570, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.530995190143585205", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216580918", "author": {"steamid": "76561198850558905", "personaname": "Novika", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198850558905/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 556, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 502, "last_played": 1769223708, "avatar": "103731b5260f7546989373bfe8ad9db7ece31e24"}, "language": "english", "review": "EFD is an incredible game overall. It's an extraction survival RPG PVE game where you customize your character (which you can change in-game any time) and continue to loot and upgrade your base. Furthermore, you can change the difficulty of the game as well. It's a cute game with fun features, with little blood effects from enemies. And only 8 hours of gameplay tells me enough that this game will be a loved treasure for any and all ages.", "timestamp_created": 1769132035, "timestamp_updated": 1769132035, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496405363082885742", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommenda