4665, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome", "timestamp_created": 1769115320, "timestamp_updated": 1769115320, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496405363082885742", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216564608", "author": {"steamid": "76561198441493502", "personaname": "Wisperingdeth", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198441493502/", "num_games_owned": 256, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1282, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 984, "deck_playtime_at_review": 259, "last_played": 1773319873, "avatar": "78a2b8998b071f7da78e4cc64477c8fa54a90340"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely brilliant even on Steam Deck. A great, chill out PvE extraction shooter that's just... FUN! Definitely one of those games that gets you thinking \"just one more go...\" 4 hours later you're still at it lol. If you're playing on Steam Deck, do yourself a favour and go into the Steam Workshop for the game, and install the mod DuckDuckCon (which requires HarmonyLib also from the Workshop) which adds controller support for the game, even including correct buttons on the UI. Assign one of the back buttons to F8, which brings up the menu for the mod allowing you to adjust things. The only change I made to the controls in the F8 menu is setting R3 to Dodge, and enabling Aim Assist. The game is actually a joy to play on Steam Deck with this mod.", "timestamp_created": 1769112167, "timestamp_updated": 1771838199, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496405363082885742", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216564428", "author": {"steamid": "76561198377361905", "personaname": "cholushkin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198377361905/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6275, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2698, "last_played": 1787378336, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Escape from Duckov is a clever parody that turns the tension of extraction shooters into something light, funny, and surprisingly engaging. A great pick if you want Escape from Tarkov vibes without the stress.", "timestamp_created": 1769111958, "timestamp_updated": 1769111958, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496405363082885742", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}]}